        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the tense final days of World War II, I.O.P<strong> </strong>is a gritty, story-driven stealth game where players embark on a dangerous mission behind enemy lines. With the Nazi regime collapsing, high-ranking officers have gone into hiding—rumors swirl that Adolf Hitler himself may have escaped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a specially trained Allied operative, your mission is to infiltrate remnants of the Nazi war machine scattered across war-torn Europe. From abandoned bunkers to snowy forests and epic scenes, you’ll use stealth, deception, and precision to uncover hidden clues, track Hitler, and dismantle what’s left of a dying empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every encounter matters. Use disguises, sabotage, and silent takedowns to avoid detection.  Can you save the world from Hitler?</p>",
